review_text:
Truly love this series! Sir is super HOT! Makensie is great, sassy and beautiful. I love a strong, independent but stubborn female :) 
 Definitely a must read! 
 @steelergerl

E aphegese einai se proto prosopo, apo ten optike gonia enos exairetika romantikou kai oneiropolou eroa (phanero kai apo ton upotitlo <<Ap' tis anamneseis enos oneiropolou>>.) Omorphe aphegese kulaei eukharista me ekrexeis entonou lurismou. 
 O oneiropolos mas loipon trigurizei stous dromous tes proteuousas, khoris skopo, khamenos stis lurikes skepseis tou, khoris na xerei anthropo, alla den ton peirazei. Mekhri pou pephtei pano sten Nastienka. Tesseris nukhtes plai sten Nastienka einai arkete na allaxei ten zoe tou; 
 Loipon, oraia aphegese, alla den trelatheka. Polus lurismos, polus romantismos...auta! Isos ta realistika keimena tou Ntostogiephki na mou tairiaxoun perissotero. 
 <<...pote me kapoia agape apo sumponia, eno polles phores mete kan ten koitane xaphnika, mesa se mia stigme, entelos aprosdoketa, ginetai aphantasta, ekplektika omorphe kai oloi ekthamboi kai magemenoi, anarotiountai athela tous: poia duname ekane na lampokopesoun me tose phloga ekeina ta thlimmena kai toso melagkholika matia; 
 sel. 17, met. Koralia Makre, ekdoseis Konidares.
